# The uppercut, on the ground, 4 s apart: whoever is ahead (3 m) is launched up, and you hop.

motion Rise on use if not linked and brawl.cd_upper <= 0 and grounded
	until brawl.uppercut.used or pressed.jump
	lasts 0.05
	change brawl.cd_upper = 4
	emit brawl.uppercut.started
	cast ray range 3
		emit brawl.uppercut.hit
		impulse 12 along up replace vertical
		impulse 6 on self along up replace vertical
